Check-digit algorithm: `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/common/Luhn.java`, `Luhn.checkDigit(String s)`:

```java
public static int checkDigit(String s) {
    if (s == null) return 0;
    int sum = 0;
    boolean dbl = true;
    for (int i = s.length() - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
        char c = s.charAt(i);
        if (c < '0' || c > '9') continue;
        int d = c - '0';
        if (dbl) { d *= 2; if (d > 9) d -= 9; }
        sum += d;
        dbl = !dbl;
    }
    return (10 - (sum % 10)) % 10;
}
```
